<> tree:member <https://model.ccmm.cz/research-data/Address.locatorName#55b1f7b0-3523-4e7a-9c3a-0377050f2641-97>.

<https://model.ccmm.cz/research-data/Address.locatorName#55b1f7b0-3523-4e7a-9c3a-0377050f2641-97> a as:Create;
    dct:isVersionOf <https://model.ccmm.cz/research-data/Address.locatorName>;
